### RailSaathi AI sample requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client). Contract: docs/API.md
# Local development backend; through the deployed frontend use https://<frontend-url>/api instead.
@base = http://localhost:8000/api

### Health and readiness
GET {{base}}/health

### Client configuration (Maps key or null, AR stations, closure simulator flag)
GET {{base}}/client-config

### ---- 1. Conversational planner ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Start a session (returns session_id and the signed session_token)
# @name session
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"language": "en"}

###
@sid = {{session.response.body.session_id}}
@token = {{session.response.body.session_token}}

### Scenario A: natural-language request
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{"message": "I need to reach Chennai before 9 AM tomorrow."}

### Answer the clarification
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{"message": "Coimbatore"}

### Passenger count and priority
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{"message": "2 passengers, cheapest please"}

### Manual correction through the form
PATCH {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/journey
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{"passenger_count": 3, "class_preference": "SL", "class_strict": false}

### Recompute recommendations
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/recommendations
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

### Select an option (copy an option_id from the recommendations; demo ids look like CBE-MAS-D103@<date>)
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/select
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{"option_id": "CBE-MAS-D103@2026-10-10"}

### Confirm for handoff (does NOT book a ticket)
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{}

### Handoff payload
GET {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/handoff
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

### Scenario E: simulated disruption (demo mode)
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/reassess
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{"event_id": "SIM-DELAY-D103"}

### Audit trail
GET {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/audit
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

### Cancel
POST {{base}}/planner/sessions/{{sid}}/cancel
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

### ---- 2. Goal planner (same session token) --------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/journey/plan
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Token: {{token}}

{"origin": "Coimbatore", "destination_station": "Chennai", "meeting_date": "2026-10-20", "meeting_time": "11:00"}

### ---- 3. Ticketing guidance ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "When does Tatkal booking open for AC classes?"}

### Knowledge sources
GET {{base}}/sources

### ---- 4. Live station information -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/live/stations/MAS/departures?hours=2

### ---- 5. Delay estimate ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/predict/delay?train_number=12623&destination=MAS

### ---- 6. Station navigation -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/stations

###
POST {{base}}/navigation/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"station_id": "chennai_central", "source": "ent_wall_tax", "destination": "platform_9", "preferences": {"avoid_stairs": true}}

### Active closures
GET {{base}}/disruptions/chennai_central
